# `1.2.3` is one bad number, not `1.2` followed by `.3`.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | extend version = 1.2.3, ip = 10.0.0.1
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..53
  PIPELINE@0..52
    LITERAL@0..12
